<section lang="en" id="en">
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
  <p>Last updated: {{ legal.updated.en }} · This is a translation; if the versions differ, the <a href="#de" hreflang="de">German version</a> applies.</p>

  <h2>In short</h2>
  <p>lernapps.net stores no data about you. There are no accounts, no forms, no cookies and no tracking. The apps run in your browser. The pages are hosted on GitHub Pages; to deliver them, GitHub processes your IP address (see <a href="#en-hosting">Hosting</a>).</p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  {% set lang = "en" %}{% include "contact.njk" %}

  <h2>Scope</h2>
  <p>This notice covers all pages and learning apps under lernapps.net, including the former addresses under lernapps.github.io that redirect to lernapps.net.</p>

  <h2 id="en-hosting">Hosting by GitHub Pages</h2>
  <p>The pages are served by GitHub Pages, provided by GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA.</p>
  <p>When you open a page, your browser sends technically necessary data to GitHub's servers: your IP address, date and time, the requested address, your browser's identifier (user agent) and, if applicable, the page you came from (referrer). GitHub uses this data to deliver the pages and to protect them against attacks, and stores it in its own logs. We have no access to these logs and receive no reports from them.</p>
  <p>The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. Our legitimate interest is to provide the pages reliably and securely. GitHub also processes data in the USA. GitHub is certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework, for which the European Commission has found an adequate level of data protection. See the <a href="https://docs.github.com/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub privacy statement</a>.</p>

  <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>We set no cookies. We use no analytics or tracking services, no advertising, and no fonts, scripts or images from third parties.</p>

  <h2>Storage in your browser</h2>
  <p>Pages and apps may keep settings and your learning progress in your browser's local storage (localStorage), for example a light or dark theme or your self-assessment. This data stays on your device and is never transmitted. You can delete it at any time in your browser settings. It is stored only for the feature you use (§ 25(2) no. 2 TDDDG).</p>

  <h2>Videos from YouTube</h2>
  <p>Apps may embed explanatory videos from YouTube. A video loads only when you click it; before that, no data is sent to YouTube. After the click, your browser loads the video from youtube-nocookie.com, and Google (Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland) receives your IP address and technical data about your browser. The legal basis is your consent given by the click (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). See the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=en">Google privacy policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>We link to other sites, mainly GitHub. If you follow a link, the privacy policy of that site applies.</p>

  <h2>Contact by email</h2>
  <p>If you write to us, we use your address and message only to reply, and delete them once the matter is settled. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.</p>

  <h2>Planned: usage statistics and error reports</h2>
  <p>We plan to add cookieless, privacy-friendly statistics to see which apps are used and whether errors occur in them. This is not active yet. Before we introduce it, we will update this notice.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right of access (Art. 15 GDPR), rectification (Art. 16), erasure (Art. 17), restriction of processing (Art. 18), data portability (Art. 20) and to object (Art. 21). You can withdraw consent at any time with effect for the future (Art. 7(3)). As we store no data about you ourselves, we can usually only confirm that; for GitHub's logs, please contact GitHub.</p>
  <p>You can also lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority, for example the one responsible for us: Der Hessische Beauftragte für Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit, Postfach 3163, 65021 Wiesbaden, Germany, <a href="https://datenschutz.hessen.de/">datenschutz.hessen.de</a>.</p>
</section>
